Here is a complete, self-contained, enterprise-grade LinkedIn Carousel Template
Designer web application built with React, TypeScript, and modern web standards.

It features:

  - A responsive, light-mode, Canva-like editorial workspace (Left sidebar,
    Center scaled canvas, Bottom slide manager).
  - Exact 4:5 vertical ratio canvas (1080 × 1350 px) with responsive
    auto-scaling and toggleable 80px safe-zone margins.
  - Direct interactive canvas element manipulation (drag, select, resize
    handles, delete).
  - Real-time editing controls: Typography, fonts, colors, line-height,
    letter-spacing, card borders, code themes, image uploads, bento-grids, and
    badges.
  - Multi-slide support: add, re-order, duplicate, delete, and real-time live
    thumbnail rendering.
  - Preset professional templates designed specifically for "Code With K"
    (Machine Learning, SQL Optimization, Power BI Dashboard, and Daily Notes).
  - High-fidelity PNG export (via client-side SVG/Canvas rasterization) and
    Multi-page PDF export (built using standard vector PDF specs with embedded
    fonts/images).
  - Local template saving & loading via JSON state.

