    resized, restyled, or translated anywhere.
2.  True Drag & Position: Select any code card, metric box, or heading on the
    slide. Drag it anywhere across the 1080 × 1350 canvas. Values synchronize
    immediately in the sidebar properties.
3.  80px Safe Margin Toggle: Click the Margins button in the top navigation bar
    to toggle the official LinkedIn mobile feed crop guide.
4.  Slide Reordering: Use arrow buttons on the bottom slide thumbnails to
    reorder presentation sequences.
5.  Client-Side Export: Click Export Slide (PNG) to generate a 1080 × 1350 px
    image. Click Export PDF Carousel to open the print engine configured for
    multi-page document carousels.
